OL,3,CFuneral director who left corpses
OL,4,Cdecomposing spent #6k on Center Parcs
OL,6,FWarning: Article contains distressing
OL,7,Fdetails
OL,9,FDisgraced funeral director Robert Bush
OL,10,Fspent more than #6,000 on trips to
OL,11,FCenter Parcs while defrauding clients,
OL,12,Fa court has heard.
OL,14,FBush paid out more than #42,000 on
OL,15,Fholidays over three years and spent
OL,16,F#17,000 on home improvements,
OL,17,Fincluding more than #7,000 on a new
OL,18,Fkitchen in 2020.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/12
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,334,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F333A1785341919
OL,3,CFuneral director who left corpses
OL,4,Cdecomposing spent #6k on Center Parcs
OL,6,FProsecutors told Hull Crown Court he
OL,7,Fspent almost #7,000 on motorcycle
OL,8,Fracing in 2021 - the year he told a
OL,9,Fgrieving mother her unborn baby had
OL,10,Fbeen cremated, while leaving his body
OL,11,Fon the floor of his Hull funeral home
OL,12,Fin a paper bag.
OL,14,FBush's personal expenditure in total
OL,15,Fcame to more than #95,000 over a seven-
OL,16,Fyear period, the court heard.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/12
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,334,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F333A1785341919
OL,3,CFuneral director who left corpses
OL,4,Cdecomposing spent #6k on Center Parcs
OL,6,FThroughout the same period Bush, who
OL,7,Fran Legacy Independent Funeral
OL,8,FDirectors, was defrauding customers by
OL,9,Ftaking money for funeral plans he was
OL,10,Fnot authorised to set up, and giving
OL,11,Ffamilies the wrong ashes for their
OL,12,Floved ones.
OL,14,FHis business was racking up debts.
OL,16,FThe judge Mr Justice Nicholas Hilliard
OL,17,FKC told prosecutor Steven Ball to read
OL,18,Fout details of Bush's spending,
OL,19,Fsaying: "People who lost their money
OL,20,Fwill want to know what it went on".
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/12
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,334,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F333A1785341919
OL,3,CFuneral director who left corpses
OL,4,Cdecomposing spent #6k on Center Parcs
OL,6,FBush, 48, is to be sentenced for 67
OL,7,Foffences spanning 12 years and
OL,8,Faffecting hundreds of victims.
OL,10,FThe court has heard how he breached
OL,11,Fthe trust placed in him by grieving
OL,12,Ffamilies "on an almost industrial
OL,13,Fscale", by keeping bodies for months
OL,14,Fafter they should have been cremated,
OL,15,Fgiving out the wrong ashes, taking
OL,16,Fmoney for funeral plans without making
OL,17,Fany of the arrangements, and stealing
OL,18,Fcharity donations collected at
OL,19,Fservices.
OL,26,@tD@JOUuD@FO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/12
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,334,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F333A1785341919
OL,3,CFuneral director who left corpses
OL,4,Cdecomposing spent #6k on Center Parcs
OL,6,FOn the third day of the sentencing
OL,7,Fhearing, prosecutors said Bush's
OL,8,Fholiday spending over seven years
OL,9,Fincluded #6,400 on three trips to
OL,10,FCenter Parcs, #3,800 on a trip to
OL,11,FItaly, and #3,000 on the holiday he
OL,12,Fwas taking with his daughter in
OL,13,FArizona when the horrors at the
OL,14,Ffuneral home were discovered.
OL,16,FRecords showed that in 2022, the year
OL,17,Fhe failed to cremate Jasmine
OL,18,FBeverley's baby Sunny Beverley-Conlin,
OL,19,Fhe spent more than #9,000 on camping
OL,20,Fexpenses.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G5/12
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,334,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F333A1785341919
OL,3,CFuneral director who left corpses
OL,4,Cdecomposing spent #6k on Center Parcs
OL,6,FProsecutors also highlighted almost
OL,7,F#10,000 of retail spending, including
OL,8,F#1,000 in Boodles jewellers, and
OL,9,F#3,385 on restaurants, including #250
OL,10,Ffor a meal at fashionable Covent
OL,11,FGarden restaurant Clos Maggiore.
OL,13,FProsecutor Steven Ball said that
OL,14,Fbetween 17 March 2017 and 8 April
OL,15,F2024, almost #1.49 million was
OL,16,Ftransferred into Bush's personal bank
OL,17,Faccount from Legacy business accounts.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G6/12
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,334,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F333A1785341919
OL,3,CFuneral director who left corpses
OL,4,Cdecomposing spent #6k on Center Parcs
OL,6,FMr Ball said that in that time the
OL,7,Ftotal received in Legacy and Bush's
OL,8,Faccounts was more than #3 million, but
OL,9,Fthe turnover reported to Companies
OL,10,FHouse and HM Revenue and Customs did
OL,11,Fnot reflect this.
OL,13,FEarlier in the day the court heard
OL,14,Fthat Bush stole money from 12
OL,15,Fcharities by not passing on donations
OL,16,Fcollected at his funeral services,
OL,17,Fincluding the Salvation Army,
OL,18,FMacmillan Cancer Support, Help for
OL,19,FHeroes, the RNLI and some local groups.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G7/12
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,334,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F333A1785341919
OL,3,CFuneral director who left corpses
OL,4,Cdecomposing spent #6k on Center Parcs
OL,6,FMary Jane Roberts collected between
OL,7,F#300 and #600 for Macmillan at the
OL,8,Ffuneral of her mother Lynne Wheal, who
OL,9,Fdied from cancer in 2022.
OL,11,FThe court heard that Bush told her:
OL,12,F"We'll take care of it, don't worry."
OL,14,FMs Roberts remembered thinking "how
OL,15,Fnice he was for giving them one less
OL,16,Fthing to worry about", but Macmillan
OL,17,Fnever received the donation.
OL,19,FWhen police raided Legacy, they found
OL,20,Fan empty envelope labelled "Donations
OL,21,Fin memory of Matthew Craig. Thank you".
OL,26,@tD@AOUtD@eO]vD@`OUxD@UO]|D@\OU}D@fO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G8/12
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,334,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33309
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F333A1785341919
OL,3,CFuneral director who left corpses
OL,4,Cdecomposing spent #6k on Center Parcs
OL,6,FThe court heard that Mr Craig died in
OL,7,FSeptember 2023, and the envelope
OL,8,Fshould have contained donations for
OL,9,FDove House Hospice, collected by his
OL,10,Fmother Jayne Waudby.
OL,12,FA judge has heard heard that Bush kept
OL,13,F31 bodies, including an unborn baby in
OL,14,Fa paper bag, at his Hull funeral home
OL,15,Fwhile telling their families they had
OL,16,Fbeen cremated and giving them the
OL,17,Fashes of a stranger.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G9/12
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,334,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33310
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F333A1785341919
OL,3,CFuneral director who left corpses
OL,4,Cdecomposing spent #6k on Center Parcs
OL,6,FHe also sold false funeral plans worth
OL,7,Fmore than #500,000 in total, covering
OL,8,Fmore than 200 people, prosecutors have
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FIn emotional scenes over two days
OL,12,Fearlier this week, more than 80 people
OL,13,Feither faced Bush to tell the stories
OL,14,Fof how he devastated their lives, or
OL,15,Fhad their statements read in court by
OL,16,Fprosecutors.
OL,18,FMany broke down in tears as they
OL,19,Fdescribed Bush's "callous" disregard
OL,20,Ffor relatives they had entrusted to
OL,21,Fhim.
OL,26,@{D@ROU{D@ZO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G10/12
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,334,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33311
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F333A1785341919
OL,3,CFuneral director who left corpses
OL,4,Cdecomposing spent #6k on Center Parcs
OL,6,FBush sat in the glass-fronted dock,
OL,7,Fwearing a dark suit as he listened to
OL,8,Fthe prosecution case against him
OL,9,Fcontinue on Wednesday morning.
OL,11,FPolice were called to Legacy's Hessle
OL,12,FRoad premises in March 2024 after
OL,13,Fconcerns were raised, and officers
OL,14,Ffound 35 bodies and more than 100 sets
OL,15,Fof ashes.
OL,17,FIn April, Bush pleaded guilty to 30
OL,18,Fcounts of preventing a lawful and
OL,19,Fdecent burial, and theft from the 12
OL,20,Fcharities.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G11/12
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,334,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33312
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F333A1785341919
OL,3,CFuneral director who left corpses
OL,4,Cdecomposing spent #6k on Center Parcs
OL,6,FHe had already admitted 30 counts of
OL,7,Ffraud by false representation relating
OL,8,Fto bodies found at the site, and four
OL,9,F"foetus allegations" of fraud, where
OL,10,Fhe presented ashes to women falsely
OL,11,Fsaying that they were "the remains of
OL,12,Ftheir unborn".
OL,14,FBush also pleaded guilty to a further
OL,15,Fcharge of fraud, covering the ashes of
OL,16,F57 people between 2017 and 2024, and
OL,17,Fone of fraudulent trading relating to
OL,18,Ffuneral plans between 2012 and 2024.
OL,26,@qD@AOUqD@TO]sD@WOUtD@MO]
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1        G12/12
